flowchart LR
    A[Business request] --> B[Existing Azure DevOps Wiki\nDesigner updates shared design page]
    B --> C[Designer creates Azure Boards\nreview item with Wiki URL]

    C --> D[Azure DevOps Service Hook\nBoard item created or submitted]
    D --> E[Azure Function\nHTTP trigger and orchestration]

    E --> F[Azure DevOps REST API\nRead linked Wiki page, revision,\nattachments and Board item]
    F --> G[Normalize and validate\nDesign package]
    G --> H[Review package context]
    H --> J[Azure Blob Storage\nVersioned input snapshot]
    H --> K[Existing Microsoft Foundry project\nNew architecture review agent]
    K --> I[Azure AI Search\nAgent retrieves targeted guidance]
    I --> K

    K --> L[CAF/WAF and Azure principles\nReview instructions]
    K --> M[Structured review result\nFindings, risks, conditions]
    M --> N[Azure Function\nValidate result and route status]

    N --> O[Azure DevOps Boards\nUpdate item with findings and links]
    O --> P[Architect manually updates\nexisting Wiki design page]
    N --> Q[Application Insights\nAudit, metrics and failures]

    P --> R{Human architecture decision}
    R -->|Changes required| B
    R -->|Approved| S[Implementation pipeline\nAzure DevOps or GitHub Actions]
    R -->|Rejected| T[Close with remediation plan]
    S --> U[Post-deployment validation\nCAF/WAF evidence and review closure]

    subgraph SecurityBoundary[Security and governance boundary]
        X[Microsoft Entra ID\nManaged identity and least privilege]
        Y[Azure Key Vault\nSecrets and certificates]
        Z[Private networking\nPrivate endpoints, DNS and egress]
    end

    X -. authenticates .-> F
    X -. authorizes .-> G
    X -. invokes .-> K
    Y -. protects .-> F
    Z -. protects .-> F
    Z -. protects .-> I
    Z -. protects .-> J
    Z -. protects .-> K